        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 2193, Contemporary Mortise Pocket Door Keyed Entry Set</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Knurled Narrow Rectangular Keyed Entry Pocket Door offers security to sliding doors and features a unique knurled designed meant to match perfectly with all of Emtek Knurled Door Hardware.  This Modern Mortise Pocket Door Keyed Entry Set is operated from the exterior by a key and by a thumbturn from the interior. The latch hooks into the door frame to secure the pocket door. The Knurled Privacy Mortise Pocket Door Hardware is one of the first with the knurled design, so you can be on the leading edge of modern home decor.  It comes packaged with 2 flush pulls, a keyed mortise lock, and all mounting hardware.  It is available in a wide selection of finishes ranging from classic to trendy, so you will be sure to find just what you are looking for. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Pocket Door Keyed Lock:</b> Use when a lock is needed. Unlocked by a key from the outside and a thumbturn on the inside. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available Matching: <a href=\"https://door-hardware-inc.myshopify.com/products/knurled-narrow-rectangular-dummy-pocket-door-set-emtek-2196-1215467\"><b>Dummy Set</b></a>, <a href=\"https://door-hardware-inc.myshopify.com/products/knurled-narrow-rectangular-passage-pocket-door-set-emtek-2194-1215444\"><b>Passage Set</b></a>, and <a href=\"https://door-hardware-inc.myshopify.com/products/knurled-narrow-rectangular-privacy-pocket-door-set-emtek-2195-1215183\"><b>Privacy Set</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Knurled Narrow Rectangular Keyed Entry Sliding Door Trim:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Trim Plate Height: 7-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Trim Plate Width: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Trim Plate Projection: 1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Mortise Box Height: 6-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Mortise Box Width: 3.43\"</li>\r\n<li>Mortise Box Face Plate Height: 8\"</li>\r\n<li>Mortise Box Face Plate Width: 7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Latch Projection: 7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/8\" or 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Mortise Finger Pull: is thrown by pressing the button on the mortise's face plate. It can be retracted simply by pressing it flush with the faceplate.</li>\r\n<li>Non-handed</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-2193-specifications.pdf?v=1718159603\"target=\"new\"><b>Emtek 2193 Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold as a Set:</b> two (2) flush pulls, a keyed mortise, and all mounting hardware. <b>For One (1) Door.</b>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Knurled Narrow Rectangular Keyed Entry Pocket Door",
                "description": "The Knurled Narrow Rectangular Keyed Entry Pocket Door offers security to sliding doors and features a unique knurled designed meant to match perfectly with all of Emtek Knurled Door Hardware.  This Modern Mortise Pocket Door Keyed Entry Set is operated from the exterior by a key and by a thumbturn from the interior. The latch hooks into the door frame to secure the pocket door. The Knurled Privacy Mortise Pocket Door Hardware is one of the first with the knurled design, so you can be on the leading edge of modern home decor.  It comes packaged with 2 flush pulls, a keyed mortise lock, and all mounting hardware.  It is available in a wide selection of finishes ranging from classic to trendy, so you will be sure to find just what you are looking for.",
